TEXT 72 -192 Left 2 ;SIM 5b - multiplier drive robustness (rev 3, 5 V)
TEXT 72 -160 Left 2 ;Tests: settled H5 with a realistic 330 ohm drive.
TEXT 72 -128 Left 2 ;Result: nominal H5 1.68 V, -20 % corner 1.02 V (3.4x what the mixer needs), no saturation.
TEXT 72 -96 Left 2 ;Explained in fm_receiver/DESIGN_LOG.md, section 'SIM 5b - multiplier drive robustness'. Old sheet notes: fm_receiver/sim_notes.md.
